lendarPage.tsx:324-328`) opens `CalendarTaskQuickCreateDialog` via `setTaskQuickCreate({ dueDay, title: '' })`. So clicking the header plus is a **task** quick-create, never a calendar-event create.\n\n### Props available on the day-header-bearing components\n\n`CalendarWeekViewProps` (`CalendarWeekView.tsx:14-25`):\n```tsx\ntype CalendarWeekViewProps = {\n  days: Temporal.PlainDate[];\n  spansByDay: Map<string, CalendarEventSpan[]>;\n  taskDuesByDay: Map<string, CalendarTaskDue[]>;\n  selectedEventId: string | null;\n  timeZone: string;\n  locale?: string;\n  onSelectEvent: (eventId: string) => void;\n  onOpenTask: (taskId: string) => void;\n  // Absent when the member cannot create tasks or deadlines are hidden.\n  onAddTask?: (day: Temporal.PlainDate) => void;\n};\n```\n\n`CalendarDayViewProps` (`CalendarDayView.tsx:16-31`):\n```tsx\ntype CalendarDayViewProps = {\n  day: Temporal.PlainDate;\n  spansByDay: Map<string, CalendarEventSpan[]>;\n  taskDuesByDay: Map<string, CalendarTaskDue[]>;\n  selectedEventId: string | null;\n  timeZone: string;\n  locale?: string;\n  onSelectEvent: (eventId: string) => void;\n  onOpenTask: (taskId: string) => void;\n  // Absent when the member cannot create tasks or deadlines are hidden.\n  onAddTask?: (day: Temporal.PlainDate) => void;\n  onCreateEventFromSlots: (range: {\n    startSlot: CalendarEventSlot;\n    endSlot: CalendarEventSlot;\n  }) => void;\n};\n```\n\n`CalendarAgendaViewProps` (`CalendarAgendaView.tsx:14-23`): `days`, `spansByDay`, `taskDuesByDay`, `selectedEventId`, `timeZone`, `locale?`, `onSelectEvent`, `onOpenTask` — **no add callback**.\n\nThere is **no `isToday` prop in the host `@/calendar` views**. The host day headers do not highlight today. (Today highlighting exists only in the generic record calendar — see §3b.)\n\n### 3b. Generic record-calendar day header (has `isToday`)\n\nFile: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/grid/components/RecordCalendarGridDay.tsx`\n\nThis is the object-record calendar grid (used by record index/page-layout widgets), not the Agenda host. Its header renders a hover-revealed \"create record\" action and today styling:\n\n`:42-75` styles, including `StyledDayHeaderDay` with `isToday`:\n```tsx\nconst StyledDayHeader = styled.div`\n  align-items: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  height: 24px;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-left: none;\n  width: 100%;\n`;\n\nconst StyledDayHeaderDayContainer = styled.div`\n  display: flex;\n  margin-left: auto;\n  padding: ${themeCssVariables.spacing['0.5']} ${themeCssVariables.spacing['0.5']};\n`;\n\nconst StyledDayHeaderDay = styled.span<{ isToday: boolean }>`\n  align-items: center;\n  background: ${({ isToday }) =>\n    isToday ? themeCssVariables.color.blue : 'transparent'};\n  border-radius: ${({ isToday }) => (isToday ? '4px' : '0')};\n  ...\n`;\n```\n\nHeader JSX (`:137-150`):\n```tsx\n<StyledDayHeader>\n  {hovered && <RecordCalendarAddNew cardDate={day} />}\n  <StyledDayHeaderDayContainer>\n    <StyledDayHeaderDay isToday={isToday}>{day.day}</StyledDayHeaderDay>\n  </StyledDayHeaderDayContainer>\n</StyledDayHeader>\n```\n\n`isToday` comes from `isSamePlainDate(day, todayInUserTimeZone)` (`:115-120`). The hover action is `RecordCalendarAddNew` (`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/.../record-calendar/components/RecordCalendarAddNew.tsx`), an `IconPlus` button whose `onClick` calls `createNewIndexRecord({ [calendarFieldMetadataItem.name]: startValue })` (`:90-114`).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Install-gating in the calendar module (checking for an installed app like a2e-documents)\n\n**There is no install-gating in the `@/calendar` module.** A grep for `application|installed|Install|documents|gate|universalIdentifier` across `src/modules/calendar` returns only unrelated hits:\n- `useCalendarEventMutations.ts:30` — a comment about gating update/delete on `isLocalCalendarEvent` (local vs provider event), not app install.\n- `CalendarEventRecord.ts:14` — \"read-only gate\" comment about `isLocalCalendarEvent`.\n- `applyAgendaTemplate.ts:178` — passes `installedApplications: { names: [], universalIdentifiers: [] }` into `resolveTemplateApplyRequestError`; i.e. the Agenda apply **hardcodes an empty install set** (Agenda has no `requiredApps`), it does not read what is installed.\n\n**The existing install-gating pattern lives outside the calendar** and is what an Agenda day-header \"daily note\" affordance would reuse:\n\n1. `applicationsSelector` — atom selector of installed app metadata (the base primitive).\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/applications/states/applicationsSelector.ts:5-12`\n   ```ts\n   export const applicationsSelector = createAtomSelector<FlatApplication[]>({\n     key: 'applicationsSelector',\n     get: ({ get }) => {\n       const storeItem = get(metadataStoreState, 'applications');\n       return storeItem.current as FlatApplication[];\n     },\n   });\n   ```\n\n2. `useTemplateGalleryItems` — executes every installed app's `list-template-descriptors` logic function and install-gates the results.\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/template-gallery/hooks/useTemplateGalleryItems.ts`\n   - Reads `applicationsSelector` (`:29`), collects logic functions (`:42-46`), then:\n   ```ts\n   const items = useMemo(\n     () =>\n       buildTemplateGalleryItems({\n         descriptorGroups: [...HOST_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTOR_GROUPS, ...descriptorGroups],\n         installedApplicationUniversalIdentifiers: applications.map(\n           (application) => application.universalIdentifier,\n         ),\n       }),\n     [descriptorGroups, applications],\n   );\n   ```\n\n3. `buildTemplateGalleryItems` — the actual gate: a descriptor is `available` only when every `requiredApps` universal identifier is installed.\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/template-gallery/utils/buildTemplateGalleryItems.ts:10-33`\n   ```ts\n   const installedApplications = new Set(installedApplicationUniversalIdentifiers);\n   return descriptorGroups.flatMap((group) =>\n     group.templates.map((descriptor) => ({\n       descriptor,\n       sourceApplication: { universalIdentifier: group.applicationUniversalIdentifier, name: group.applicationName },\n       available: descriptor.requiredApps.every((requiredApplication) =>\n         installedApplications.has(requiredApplication),\n       ),\n     })),\n   );\n   ```\n\n4. `TemplateGalleryEntryPoint` — renders `null` when none of its required apps are installed (embeddable install-gated entry point).\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/template-gallery/components/TemplateGalleryEntryPoint.tsx:24-44`\n   ```tsx\n   const applications = useAtomStateValue(applicationsSelector);\n   const installedUniversalIdentifiers = new Set(\n     applications.map((application) => application.universalIdentifier),\n   );\n   const isAvailable = requiredApplicationUniversalIdentifiers.some(\n     (universalIdentifier) => installedUniversalIdentifiers.has(universalIdentifier),\n   );\n   if (!isAvailable) return null;\n   ```\n\n5. `useA2eSuiteApplications` — splits installed vs. available A2E apps (including a2e-documents) using `FindManyApplicationsDocument` + `useMarketplaceApps`.\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/hooks/useA2eSuiteApplications.ts:15-56`.\n\n6. a2e-documents universal identifier constant:\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/a2e-workspace/constants/A2eSuiteApplicationUniversalIdentifiers.ts:5-7`\n   ```ts\n   export const A2E_SUITE_APPLICATION_UNIVERSAL_IDENTIFIERS: string[] = [\n     // a2e-documents\n     '19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48',\n     ...\n   ];\n   ```\n\n7. `useInstalledApplications` — the simpler \"all installed apps\" query hook.\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/applications/hooks/useInstalledApplications.ts:9-33`.\n\n**Bottom line:** if you need to gate an Agenda day-header affordance on a2e-documents being installed, there is no existing calendar-module hook to reuse; the established idiom is `useAtomStateValue(applicationsSelector)` (as in `TemplateGalleryEntryPoint`) or `useA2eSuiteApplications()`, comparing against the `19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48` constant.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Daily note / journal affordance in the calendar\n\n**None exists in the calendar today.** No `daily note`, `journal`, `dailyNote`, or `Journal` match exists anywhere under `src/modules/calendar` (only recurrence-frequency \"daily\" hits).\n\nIt is an explicitly planned, unbuilt feature:\n\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/PLAN.md:370-372`:\n  ```\n  - [ ] **M8e — Quick capture & daily note.** Global shortcut (Cmd+Shift+N) and\n        Cmd+K \"New page\" creating an untitled doc in Inbox/personal root; opt-in\n        daily note (template from M9) opened from Agenda day header.\n  ```\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/PLAN.md:186` (gap G10): \"No global 'new page' shortcut, no daily note, no unified 'Today' …\".\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/PLAN.md:411-414` lists \"daily note\" among the M9c Bureau page templates (journal ✔, weekly review, daily note, …).\n\nThe journal content itself exists **only as an `a2e-documents` starter template**, not as a calendar surface:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/src/lib/starter-templates.ts:33-35` — `title: 'Modèle — Journal'` with a markdown journal skeleton.\n- `.../starter-templates.ts:68-70` — `'Modèle — Journal de décisions (ADR)'`.\n- Descriptor labels: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/src/lib/document-template-descriptors.ts:29,36`.\n- A \"daily note\" starter was added in phase 13: `/Users/maxaubert/P