        "result": "<task id=\"ses_f0768fb18ffeu1nuVGKpP1UZGF\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nI have a complete picture. Here is my report.\n\n---\n\n# Agenda / calendar host UI — day headers in `packages/twenty-front`\n\n## 0. TL;DR\n\n- The Agenda/calendar host module is `packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/`, mounted by `packages/twenty-front/src/pages/calendar/CalendarPage.tsx` at route `/calendar`.\n- Day headers live in **three** view components: `CalendarWeekView.tsx` (per-column header), `CalendarDayView.tsx` (single day header), and `CalendarAgendaView.tsx` (per-day group heading). There is **no** dedicated `DayHeader` / `CalendarDay` component — every header is an inline Linaria-styled `h3` (`StyledDayHeader` / `StyledDayHeading`).\n- The **only** action currently in a host-calendar day header is an \"add task due\" `IconPlus` button, gated by `onAddTask`, in `CalendarWeekView` and `CalendarDayView`.\n- There is **no install-gating anywhere in the `@/calendar` module**. The install-gating pattern lives in `@/template-gallery` (`applicationsSelector`, `useTemplateGalleryItems`, `buildTemplateGalleryItems`, `TemplateGalleryEntryPoint`) and `@/a2e-workspace/hooks/useA2eSuiteApplications`.\n- There is **no daily-note / journal affordance in the calendar** today. It is a planned, not-yet-built feature: PLAN.md M8e explicitly says \"opt-in daily note (template from M9) opened from Agenda day header\" (`PLAN.md:370-372`). The journal exists only as an app starter template inside `a2e-documents`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Module location and directory structure\n\n**Host module:** `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/`\n\n```\ncalendar/\n├── components/\n│   ├── CalendarAgendaView.tsx        # agenda mode: per-day group headings\n│   ├── CalendarDayTimeGrid.tsx       # day mode: hour slots, no date header\n│   ├── CalendarDayView.tsx           # day mode: single day header + list + time grid\n│   ├── CalendarEventBlock.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarEventChip.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarEventComposer.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarEventDetails.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarMonthView.tsx         # month grid: weekday column headers + day numbers\n│   ├── CalendarRecurrenceFields.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarSeriesScopeDialog.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarTaskDueChip.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarTaskQuickCreateDialog.tsx\n│   ├── CalendarToolbar.tsx           # day/week/month/agenda mode switch\n│   └── CalendarWeekView.tsx          # week mode: day columns + per-column headers\n├── constants/  (AgendaTemplateDescriptors, AgendaTemplateDefinitions, CalendarDayMinutes, …)\n├── hooks/      (useAgendaTemplateApply, useCalendarEventMutations, useCalendarEvents,\n│                useCalendarTaskDueDates, useCalendarTaskQuickCreate)\n├── types/      (CalendarViewMode, CalendarEventSpan, CalendarTaskDue, …)\n└── utils/      (getCalendarViewDays, expandCalendarEventsForRange, groupCalendarEventsByDay, …)\n```\n\n**Host page / mount:**\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/pages/calendar/CalendarPage.tsx` — the container (`CalendarPage`, line 100). It owns `mode`, `anchorDate`, the `onAddTask` callback, and renders the four views.\n- Route registration: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/app/routing/utils/createWorkspaceRouteObjects.tsx:62-64` (lazy import) and `:182` (`<CalendarPage />`).\n\n**View dispatch in `CalendarPage.tsx:897-949`:**\n- `month` → `CalendarMonthView`\n- `week` → `CalendarWeekView`\n- `day` → `CalendarDayView`\n- `agenda` → `CalendarAgendaView`\n\n**Components rendering day headers/columns in week/day views:**\n| View | Component | Day header element | Columns |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| week | `CalendarWeekView.tsx` | `StyledDayHeaderRow` / `StyledDayHeader` (per day) | `StyledDayColumn` (7-col grid) |\n| day | `CalendarDayView.tsx` | `StyledDayHeaderRow` / `StyledDayHeader` (single day) | `CalendarDayTimeGrid` (hour slots) |\n| agenda | `CalendarAgendaView.tsx` | `StyledDayHeading` (per day group) | day groups, not columns |\n\nA separate, generic record-calendar grid also renders a day header: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/grid/components/RecordCalendarGridDay.tsx` (used by record views/page-layout widgets, not by `CalendarPage`). Covered in §3b.\n\n---\n\n## 2. Exact component and JSX for day headers\n\n### 2a. Week view — `CalendarWeekView.tsx`\n\nFile: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarWeekView.tsx`\n\nHeader styles (`:51-64`):\n```tsx\nconst StyledDayHeaderRow = styled.div`\n  align-items: center;\n  display: flex;\n  gap: ${themeCssVariables.spacing[1]};\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  min-height: 24px;\n`;\n\nconst StyledDayHeader = styled.h3`\n  color: ${themeCssVariables.font.color.secondary};\n  font-size: ${themeCssVariables.font.size.xs};\n  font-weight: ${themeCssVariables.font.weight.medium};\n  margin: 0;\n`;\n```\n\nHeader JSX inside the `days.map(...)` (`:88-113`):\n```tsx\n{days.map((day) => {\n  const daySpans = spansByDay.get(day.toString()) ?? [];\n  const dayTaskDues = taskDuesByDay.get(day.toString()) ?? [];\n  const dayLabel = day.toLocaleString(locale, { dateStyle: 'full' });\n\n  return (\n    <StyledDayColumn role=\"listitem\" key={day.toString()}>\n      <StyledDayHeaderRow>\n        <StyledDayHeader>\n          {day.toLocaleString(locale, {\n            weekday: 'short',\n            day: 'numeric',\n            month: 'short',\n          })}\n        </StyledDayHeader>\n        {isDefined(onAddTask) && (\n          <Button\n            ariaLabel={t`Add a task due ${dayLabel}`}\n            Icon={IconPlus}\n            size=\"small\"\n            variant=\"tertiary\"\n            dataTestId={`calendar-week-add-task-${day.toString()}`}\n            onClick={() => onAddTask(day)}\n          />\n        )}\n      </StyledDayHeaderRow>\n      ...\n```\n\n### 2b. Day view — `CalendarDayView.tsx`\n\nFile: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarDayView.tsx`\n\nHeader styles (`:43-57`):\n```tsx\nconst StyledDayHeaderRow = styled.div`\n  align-items: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-wrap: wrap;\n  gap: ${themeCssVariables.spacing[2]};\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  max-width: 720px;\n`;\n\nconst StyledDayHeader = styled.h3`\n  color: ${themeCssVariables.font.color.primary};\n  font-size: ${themeCssVariables.font.size.md};\n  font-weight: ${themeCssVariables.font.weight.semiBold};\n  margin: 0;\n`;\n```\n\nHeader JSX (`:89-106`):\n```tsx\nreturn (\n  <StyledDay aria-label={t`Day calendar`}>\n    <StyledDayHeaderRow>\n      <StyledDayHeader>\n        {day.toLocaleString(locale, { dateStyle: 'full' })}\n      </StyledDayHeader>\n      {isDefined(onAddTask) && (\n        <Button\n          title={t`Add task`}\n          ariaLabel={t`Add a task due on this day`}\n          Icon={IconPlus}\n          size=\"small\"\n          variant=\"secondary\"\n          dataTestId=\"calendar-day-add-task\"\n          onClick={() => onAddTask(day)}\n        />\n      )}\n    </StyledDayHeaderRow>\n    ...\n```\n\nThe day's timed events are rendered by `CalendarDayTimeGrid.tsx` (`:208-270`), which has **no date header** — only hour-slot labels and the slot-click/slot-drag \"create event\" affordance (`onCreateEventFromSlots`, `commitSelection` at `:146-158`).\n\n### 2c. Agenda view — `CalendarAgendaView.tsx`\n\nFile: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarAgendaView.tsx`\n\nHeading style (`:41-46`):\n```tsx\nconst StyledDayHeading = styled.h3`\n  color: ${themeCssVariables.font.color.secondary};\n  font-size: ${themeCssVariables.font.size.sm};\n  font-weight: ${themeCssVariables.font.weight.medium};\n  margin: 0;\n`;\n```\n\nHeading JSX (`:127-131`):\n```tsx\ndaysWithEvents.map((day) => (\n  <StyledDayGroup key={day.toString()}>\n    <StyledDayHeading>\n      {day.toLocaleString(locale, { dateStyle: 'full' })}\n    </StyledDayHeading>\n    ...\n```\n\nNote: agenda only renders days that have events or task dues (`:116-120`), and it has **no `onAddTask` / `onAddEvent` action at all**.\n\n### 2d. Month view — `CalendarMonthView.tsx`\n\nFile: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/calendar/components/CalendarMonthView.tsx`\n- Weekday column headers: `StyledWeekday` (`:35-42`), rendered at `:79-83`.\n- Day numbers: `StyledDayNumber` (`:54-57`), rendered at `:102`. No per-day action button.\n\n---\n\n## 3. How the day header renders the date, existing actions, props, and click behavior\n\n### Date rendering\nAll three host views render dates via `Temporal.PlainDate` → `toLocaleString(locale, …)`:\n- Week: `weekday: 'short', day: 'numeric', month: 'short'` (`CalendarWeekView.tsx:97-101`); full label computed separately for aria (`dayLabel`, `:91`).\n- Day: `dateStyle: 'full'` (`CalendarDayView.tsx:93`).\n- Agenda: `dateStyle: 'full'` (`CalendarAgendaView.tsx:130`).\n- `locale` is threaded from `CalendarPage` via `dateLocale.locale` (`CalendarPage.tsx:906/918/931/945`), and `timeZone` from `useDateTimeFormat()`.\n\n### Existing actions in the host day headers\nOnly **add-task**, not add-event:\n- `CalendarWeekView.tsx:103-112` — `IconPlus` tertiary `Button`, `dataTestId=\"calendar-week-add-task-<date>\"`, `onClick={() => onAddTask(day)}`.\n- `CalendarDayView.tsx:95-105` — `IconPlus` secondary `Button`, `dataTestId=\"calendar-day-add-task\"`, `onClick={() => onAddTask(day)}`.\n- Agenda and month headers have no action.\n\nThe button appears only when `onAddTask` is defined. The wrapper decides:\n\n`CalendarPage.tsx:355-358`:\n```tsx\n// Quick-create belongs to the deadline overlay: hidden with it, and never\n// offered to a member who cannot create tasks.\nconst onAddTask =\n  showTaskDueDates && canCreateTasks ? handleAddTask : undefined;\n```\n`handleAddTask` (`CalendarPage.tsx:324-328`) opens `CalendarTaskQuickCreateDialog` via `setTaskQuickCreate({ dueDay, title: '' })`. So clicking the header plus is a **task** quick-create, never a calendar-event create.\n\n### Props available on the day-header-bearing components\n\n`CalendarWeekViewProps` (`CalendarWeekView.tsx:14-25`):\n```tsx\ntype CalendarWeekViewProps = {\n  days: Temporal.PlainDate[];\n  spansByDay: Map<string, CalendarEventSpan[]>;\n  taskDuesByDay: Map<string, CalendarTaskDue[]>;\n  selectedEventId: string | null;\n  timeZone: string;\n  locale?: string;\n  onSelectEvent: (eventId: string) => void;\n  onOpenTask: (taskId: string) => void;\n  // Absent when the member cannot create tasks or deadlines are hidden.\n  onAddTask?: (day: Temporal.PlainDate) => void;\n};\n```\n\n`CalendarDayViewProps` (`CalendarDayView.tsx:16-31`):\n```tsx\ntype CalendarDayViewProps = {\n  day: Temporal.PlainDate;\n  spansByDay: Map<string, CalendarEventSpan[]>;\n  taskDuesByDay: Map<string, CalendarTaskDue[]>;\n  selectedEventId: string | null;\n  timeZone: string;\n  locale?: string;\n  onSelectEvent: (eventId: string) => void;\n  onOpenTask: (taskId: string) => void;\n  // Absent when the member cannot create tasks or deadlines are hidden.\n  onAddTask?: (day: Temporal.PlainDate) => void;\n  onCreateEventFromSlots: (range: {\n    startSlot: CalendarEventSlot;\n    endSlot: CalendarEventSlot;\n  }) => void;\n};\n```\n\n`CalendarAgendaViewProps` (`CalendarAgendaView.tsx:14-23`): `days`, `spansByDay`, `taskDuesByDay`, `selectedEventId`, `timeZone`, `locale?`, `onSelectEvent`, `onOpenTask` — **no add callback**.\n\nThere is **no `isToday` prop in the host `@/calendar` views**. The host day headers do not highlight today. (Today highlighting exists only in the generic record calendar — see §3b.)\n\n### 3b. Generic record-calendar day header (has `isToday`)\n\nFile: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/object-record/record-calendar/grid/components/RecordCalendarGridDay.tsx`\n\nThis is the object-record calendar grid (used by record index/page-layout widgets), not the Agenda host. Its header renders a hover-revealed \"create record\" action and today styling:\n\n`:42-75` styles, including `StyledDayHeaderDay` with `isToday`:\n```tsx\nconst StyledDayHeader = styled.div`\n  align-items: center;\n  display: flex;\n  flex-direction: row;\n  height: 24px;\n  justify-content: space-between;\n  margin-left: none;\n  width: 100%;\n`;\n\nconst StyledDayHeaderDayContainer = styled.div`\n  display: flex;\n  margin-left: auto;\n  padding: ${themeCssVariables.spacing['0.5']} ${themeCssVariables.spacing['0.5']};\n`;\n\nconst StyledDayHeaderDay = styled.span<{ isToday: boolean }>`\n  align-items: center;\n  background: ${({ isToday }) =>\n    isToday ? themeCssVariables.color.blue : 'transparent'};\n  border-radius: ${({ isToday }) => (isToday ? '4px' : '0')};\n  ...\n`;\n```\n\nHeader JSX (`:137-150`):\n```tsx\n<StyledDayHeader>\n  {hovered && <RecordCalendarAddNew cardDate={day} />}\n  <StyledDayHeaderDayContainer>\n    <StyledDayHeaderDay isToday={isToday}>{day.day}</StyledDayHeaderDay>\n  </StyledDayHeaderDayContainer>\n</StyledDayHeader>\n```\n\n`isToday` comes from `isSamePlainDate(day, todayInUserTimeZone)` (`:115-120`). The hover action is `RecordCalendarAddNew` (`/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/.../record-calendar/components/RecordCalendarAddNew.tsx`), an `IconPlus` button whose `onClick` calls `createNewIndexRecord({ [calendarFieldMetadataItem.name]: startValue })` (`:90-114`).\n\n---\n\n## 4. Install-gating in the calendar module (checking for an installed app like a2e-documents)\n\n**There is no install-gating in the `@/calendar` module.** A grep for `application|installed|Install|documents|gate|universalIdentifier` across `src/modules/calendar` returns only unrelated hits:\n- `useCalendarEventMutations.ts:30` — a comment about gating update/delete on `isLocalCalendarEvent` (local vs provider event), not app install.\n- `CalendarEventRecord.ts:14` — \"read-only gate\" comment about `isLocalCalendarEvent`.\n- `applyAgendaTemplate.ts:178` — passes `installedApplications: { names: [], universalIdentifiers: [] }` into `resolveTemplateApplyRequestError`; i.e. the Agenda apply **hardcodes an empty install set** (Agenda has no `requiredApps`), it does not read what is installed.\n\n**The existing install-gating pattern lives outside the calendar** and is what an Agenda day-header \"daily note\" affordance would reuse:\n\n1. `applicationsSelector` — atom selector of installed app metadata (the base primitive).\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/applications/states/applicationsSelector.ts:5-12`\n   ```ts\n   export const applicationsSelector = createAtomSelector<FlatApplication[]>({\n     key: 'applicationsSelector',\n     get: ({ get }) => {\n       const storeItem = get(metadataStoreState, 'applications');\n       return storeItem.current as FlatApplication[];\n     },\n   });\n   ```\n\n2. `useTemplateGalleryItems` — executes every installed app's `list-template-descriptors` logic function and install-gates the results.\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/template-gallery/hooks/useTemplateGalleryItems.ts`\n   - Reads `applicationsSelector` (`:29`), collects logic functions (`:42-46`), then:\n   ```ts\n   const items = useMemo(\n     () =>\n       buildTemplateGalleryItems({\n         descriptorGroups: [...HOST_TEMPLATE_DESCRIPTOR_GROUPS, ...descriptorGroups],\n         installedApplicationUniversalIdentifiers: applications.map(\n           (application) => application.universalIdentifier,\n         ),\n       }),\n     [descriptorGroups, applications],\n   );\n   ```\n\n3. `buildTemplateGalleryItems` — the actual gate: a descriptor is `available` only when every `requiredApps` universal identifier is installed.\n   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/template-gal