   File: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-front/src/modules/applications/hooks/useInstalledApplications.ts:9-33`.\n\n**Bottom line:** if you need to gate an Agenda day-header affordance on a2e-documents being installed, there is no existing calendar-module hook to reuse; the established idiom is `useAtomStateValue(applicationsSelector)` (as in `TemplateGalleryEntryPoint`) or `useA2eSuiteApplications()`, comparing against the `19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48` constant.\n\n---\n\n## 5. Daily note / journal affordance in the calendar\n\n**None exists in the calendar today.** No `daily note`, `journal`, `dailyNote`, or `Journal` match exists anywhere under `src/modules/calendar` (only recurrence-frequency \"daily\" hits).\n\nIt is an explicitly planned, unbuilt feature:\n\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/PLAN.md:370-372`:\n  ```\n  - [ ] **M8e — Quick capture & daily note.** Global shortcut (Cmd+Shift+N) and\n        Cmd+K \"New page\" creating an untitled doc in Inbox/personal root; opt-in\n        daily note (template from M9) opened from Agenda day header.\n  ```\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/PLAN.md:186` (gap G10): \"No global 'new page' shortcut, no daily note, no unified 'Today' …\".\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/PLAN.md:411-414` lists \"daily note\" among the M9c Bureau page templates (journal ✔, weekly review, daily note, …).\n\nThe journal content itself exists **only as an `a2e-documents` starter template**, not as a calendar surface:\n- `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/src/lib/starter-templates.ts:33-35` — `title: 'Modèle — Journal'` with a markdown journal skeleton.\n- `.../starter-templates.ts:68-70` — `'Modèle — Journal de décisions (ADR)'`.\n- Descriptor labels: `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents/src/lib/document-template-descriptors.ts:29,36`.\n- A \"daily note\" starter was added in phase 13: `/Users/maxaubert/Proje