        "result": "<task id=\"ses_f0768fb56ffeYha706eEqe9mcC\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nI have gathered comprehensive findings. Here is the full report.\n\n---\n\n# 1. The `a2e-documents` app\n\n**Location:** `/Users/maxaubert/Projets/A2E Suite/packages/twenty-apps/internal/a2e-documents`\n\nThis is the app whose display name is **Bureau** (`a2e-documents` is the package name; Bureau is the product identity).\n\n### Application config / manifest\n`.../a2e-documents/src/application.config.ts`:\n```ts\nimport { defineApplication } from 'twenty-sdk/define';\n\nexport const APPLICATION_UNIVERSAL_IDENTIFIER =\n  '19126a9c-7cc0-4368-aaba-c7e5a87b0c48';\n\nexport default defineApplication({\n  universalIdentifier: APPLICATION_UNIVERSAL_IDENTIFIER,\n  displayName: 'Bureau',\n  description:\n    'Bureau — pages et notes : arborescence de documents, éditeur riche, modèles et partage',\n});\n```\nBuilt manifest: `.../a2e-documents/.twenty/output/manifest.json` (1139 lines). Key registered artifacts:\n- `document` object `c31a0100-0000-4000-8000-000000000000` (manifest lines 18–276), plus `documentCommentThread`, `documentRevision`, `documentFavorite`, `documentMention`.\n- Logic functions (manifest lines 630–846): `post-install`, `purge-archived-documents`, `guard-document-parent-cycle`, `document-content`, `guard-document-revision-save`, `summarize-document`, `translate-document`, `improve-document-writing`, `list-template-descriptors`, `apply-template`, `index-document-mentions`.\n- Front components (lines 847–914): `document-browser`, `document-page`, `create-document-command`, `save-company-as-document-command`, `save-person-as-document-command`, `save-document-as-template-command`.\n- Views (lines 916–1005): `Tous les documents` (TABLE, `openRecordIn: SIDE_PANEL`), `Modèles` (LIST, `kind = TEMPLATE`, `SIDE_PANEL`).\n- Page layout `Document Record Page` (lines 1025–1086).\n- Navigation: `Pages` view row nested under folder `Bureau` (lines 1007–1024).\n\n### Source structure\n```\nsrc/\n├── application.config.ts\n├── command-menu-items/        (create-document, create-document-and-open, go-to-documents, save-*-as-document, save-document-as-template)\n├── constants/                 (universal-identifiers.ts, field-vocabulary.ts)\n├── fields/                    (person/company documents, chrome fields, templateApplyOperationId)\n├── front-components/          (document-browser, document-page, create-document-command, save-* command factory/components)\n├── lib/                       (apply-template, document-template-descriptors, instantiate-template, starter-templates, template-gallery, document-tree, …)\n├── logic-functions/           (apply-template, list-template-descriptors, document-content, translate-document, …)\n├── navigation-menu-items/     (documents.navigation-menu-item.ts, bureau-folder.navigation-menu-item.ts)\n├── objects/                   (document, document-mention, document-favorite, document-revision, document-comment-thread)\n├── page-layouts/              (document.page-layout.ts)\n├── roles/                     (default-function.role.ts)\n└── views/                     (all-documents.view.ts, templates.view.ts)\n```\n\n### The logic functions you asked about\n\n**`apply-template`** — `src/logic-functions/apply-template.ts` (whole file, 50 lines):\n```ts\nconst handler = async (payload: ApplyTemplateRequest) =>\n  applyDocumentTemplateByKey(\n    new CoreApiClient(),\n    {\n      key: typeof payload?.key === 'string' ? payload.key : '',\n      inputs: payload?.inputs ?? null,\n      operationId: payload?.operationId ?? null,\n    },\n    { getInstalledApplications: readInstalledApplications },\n  );\n\nexport default defineLogicFunction({\n  universalIdentifier: LOGIC_FUNCTION_IDS.applyTemplate,   // c31a0000-0012-...000a\n  name: 'apply-template',\n  description: 'Applique un modèle de page listé par A2E Documents …',\n  timeoutSeconds: 120,\n  handler,\n});\n```\n- `readInstalledApplications` (lines